# TODO: Translation updated at 2024-09-19 01:01

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:28
translate chinese start_7263dc42:

    # "Before we start the game, there are a few key choices you'll need to make to customize your experience."
    "在我们开始游戏之前，您需要做出一些关键选择来自定义您的体验。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:30
translate chinese start_d33a07aa:

    # "First, are you interested in customizing the style and names of characters?"
    "首先，您是否想要自定义角色的外表和名称？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:36
translate chinese start_c78ad4cd:

    # "Let's handle these now so they don't interrupt the story later."
    "让我们现在来处理此事，以使后续的故事不被打断。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:40
translate chinese start_e1349bc9:

    # "I can tell that this isn't the first time you've started a new game. Would you like to skip the introduction?"
    "我看得出这不是你第一次玩新游戏。你想跳过介绍吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:47
translate chinese start_b5854eec:

    # "Let's start with you! What's your name?"
    "让我们开始吧！你叫什么名字？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:52
translate chinese start_d5532e81:

    # "Ah, [mc]! I remember now! You've had quite an adventure, haven't you?"
    "啊，[mc]！我想起来了！你经历了一场大冒险，不是吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:58
translate chinese start_9bf74020:

    # "Interesting! Don't worry, I'll catch you up to speed real quick!"
    "真有意思！但别担心，我会很快让你跟上进度的！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:64
translate chinese intro_36f0dfe5:

    # "When you first arrived in this world, two mares welcomed you and showed you around."
    "你刚来到这个世界时，有两位雌驹接纳了你并带你四处参观。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:66
translate chinese intro_699b90f3:

    # "It didn’t take long for you to get balls deep."
    "没过多久，你就和女孩们鬼混到一起了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:68
translate chinese intro_aa80e636:

    # "The memories are a bit hazy... Do you recall their names and what they looked like?"
    "这些记忆有些模糊……你还记得她们的名字与样貌吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:146
translate chinese intro_f6d58033:

    # "You visited a farm and helped a girl cope with her grief over losing a loved one."
    "你拜访了一个农场，帮助一个女孩应对失去双亲的悲痛。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:148
translate chinese intro_b28caadc:

    # "Turns out, they weren’t kidding about how good cow girls are on top."
    "事实证明，女牛仔的骑术可不是开玩笑的。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:169
translate chinese intro_234ae890:

    # "You stopped by a struggling boutique and gave the lady there the support she needed to turn her business around."
    "你驻足一家陷入困境的精品店，为店里的女士提供了扭亏为盈所需的支持。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:171
translate chinese intro_e12ed097:

    # "She was more than happy to show her appreciation. You still remember the feeling of her fluffy butt in your hands."
    "她很乐意表达她的感激之情。你仍记得她毛茸茸皮屁在手中的感觉。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:192
translate chinese intro_5c85db21:

    # "In the forest, you found a girl dealing with deadly succubus powers and helped her cure them."
    "在森林里，你发现了一个患有致命魅魔症的女孩，帮助她治愈了魅魔症。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:194
translate chinese intro_872ba75a:

    # "Once she was no longer dangerous, the real fun began!"
    "发现她不再危险后，真正的趣事就开始了！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:212
translate chinese intro_d5b98fde:

    # "Back in the city centre, you met a girl running a bar. She was struggling and uncertain, but you offered the support she needed to find herself."
    "在市中心，你遇到了一个经营酒吧的女孩。她那时挣扎而又彷徨，但你为她提供了找到自我所需的支持。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:214
translate chinese intro_dff1730b:

    # "And in the process, discovered she was quite the butt slut."
    "在这一过程中，你帮她发现她其实是个彻头彻尾的屁穴控。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:237
translate chinese intro_0c2413fb:

    # "At the tree library, you helped the queen's timid student break out of her shell."
    "在树屋图书馆，你帮助女王的自闭学生“破壳而出”。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:239
translate chinese intro_011bfcf5:

    # "With explosive results as all that pent-up frustration was unleashed on you!"
    "当所有压抑的挫败感都发泄在你身上时，可真是爆炸性的结果！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:260
translate chinese intro_9d4242ba:

    # "And who could forget the amazing party we had at my bakery?"
    "而又怎能忘记我们在我的烘焙坊举办的那场精彩派对呢？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:262
translate chinese intro_d7df1ebe:

    # "Although I wonder if there’s anything else we forgot there? Hehe, probably not!"
    "不过，也许我们还忘了什么？嘿嘿，可能没有吧！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:281
translate chinese intro_c0e7739b:

    # "After all that fun, the next step was meeting the princess and queen themselves!"
    "这些欢愉之后，接下来就是觐见公主和女王了！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:306
translate chinese intro_5e629e9f:

    # "However, this was all part of an evil plan by Morrigan, the Morphling Queen, ever since you arrived in Arcadia."
    "然而，你来到Arcadia后做的事几乎都是幻形灵女王Morrigan邪恶计划的一部分。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:307
translate chinese intro_41ebf4d0:

    # "Only once [mox] received enough power was she able to separate and defeat them."
    "只有当 [mox] 获得足够的力量后，她才能将它们分开并击败。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:312
translate chinese intro_9c16dc39:

    # "Leading to a lifetime of peace!"
    "以此带来了一个时代的和平！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:333
translate chinese intro_59d63fea:

    # "The first thing I noticed about this universe was the rain."
    "我对这个宇宙的第一印象就是雨。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:334
translate chinese intro_8d81561c:

    # "The sound of heavy rainfall on glass was so foreign to me. It was proof that I was no longer home."
    "大雨打在玻璃上的声音对我来说是如此陌生。这证明我已经不在家了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:335
translate chinese intro_ef4c685a:

    # "But one comforting thing remained the same... the ponies here don't wear clothes either."
    "但有一件令人欣慰的事保持不变……这里的小马也不穿衣服。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:341
translate chinese intro_c2102e39:

    # mox "Pardon me, but what did you say your name was again?"
    mox "抱歉，你刚才说你叫什么来着？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:342
translate chinese intro_ea313ef1:

    # "I looked over to who should be the most familiar person to me in any universe. She was my lover, my best friend, and a complete stranger."
    "我看向在所有宇宙中我最熟悉的雌驹。她是我的爱人，我最好的朋友，也是一个完全陌生的人……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:343
translate chinese intro_bd7d9df9:

    # mc "[mc]."
    mc "[mc]。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:345
translate chinese intro_d619e748:

    # mox "Nope, I've never heard of you! I thought you were just a familiar. I can't believe you have a name and a history! Have we really met before?"
    mox "不，我从来没听说过你！我以为你只是个召唤物。真不敢相信你有名字和来历，我们真的见过面吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:346
translate chinese intro_1f75c24f:

    # mc "Calling it a meeting would be an understatement."
    mc "（称此时此刻为会面未免太过轻描淡写了……）"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:347
translate chinese intro_ac6d2183:

    # "In a flash of bright purple light, I was teleported here. An all-too-familiar experience."
    "（在一束耀眼的紫光中，我被传送到了这里。我再熟悉不过的经历。）"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:348
translate chinese intro_ebfe6ab6:

    # "With an interdimensional spell, I was torn from my reality and transported to a new dimension. [mox] must have cast the spell. I never imagined this would happen again."
    "我被一个跨宇宙魔法从现实中扯出来，传送到了一个新的次元，一定是[mox]施了咒语。真不敢相信这种事情会再次发生。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:350
translate chinese intro_9bc40a28:

    # mox "I… I can hardly believe it! I'm really sorry if that's true!"
    mox "我……我简直不敢相信！如果这是真的，我很抱歉！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:351
translate chinese intro_29cf864c:

    # mc "I'm struggling to believe it myself. I spent so long building my life in Arcadia, making friends, and making love."
    mc "我自己也难以相信。我花了那么长时间在Arcadia建立自己的生活，交朋友...还有做爱。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:352
translate chinese intro_43ae02fc:

    # mc "Could all that really be gone... just like that?"
    mc "难道这一切真的就这样......消失了吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:354
translate chinese intro_6f9c81f5:

    # "[mox] blushes slightly as she focuses on the ‘making love’ part. Her reaction snaps me back to reality."
    "当她注意到 “做爱 ”一词时，[mox]的脸微微红了。她的反应把我拉回了现实。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:355
translate chinese intro_d4f33dc4:

    # mc "There has to be a way to get back!"
    mc "一定有办法回去的！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:357
translate chinese intro_6a5b21e9:

    # mox "Hang on! I have a friend arriving any second! We were going to summon a familiar, you know, a magical puppet that just follows orders."
    mox "等一下！我有个朋友马上就到！我们计划好了召唤一个傀儡，你知道的，一个 听 命 行 事 的魔法傀儡。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:361
translate chinese intro_1179b9ee:

    # "The doorbell rang, and [mox] skipped to another room to answer it."
    "门铃响了，[mox]蹦蹦跳跳的到另一个房间去开门。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:362
translate chinese intro_4e75bc05:

    # "A… doorbell? [mox] doesn’t have a doorbell. This is all different. My senses were a mess, so I had barely taken the time to analyse my surroundings."
    "...门铃？[mox] 可没有门铃。这完全不一样。我的脑袋一团糟，几乎无法分析周围的环境。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:363
translate chinese intro_21aa3f58:

    # "This wasn't just a wagon; if this was [mox]'s home, it was a full apartment. Clean and well-lived in."
    "这绝不是一辆篷车；如果这是[mox]的家的话，那这可是一个完整的公寓。干净整洁，适合居住。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:364
translate chinese intro_a00152c2:

    # "What kind of world is this anyway?"
    "这到底是个什么样的世界？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:365
translate chinese intro_5c070bdb:

    # "Another character entered the room, her eyes widening in surprise when she saw me. I wish I could say I was equally surprised."
    "另一个雌驹走进房间，当她看到我时，她惊讶的瞪大了眼睛，但愿我能说我同样感到惊讶。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:366
translate chinese intro_52ad89c7:

    # "I whispered her name under my breath as soon as I saw her..."
    "我一见到她就低声喊出了她的名字……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:369
translate chinese intro_0d2f3d0e:

    # pen "That’s me! But… who are you?"
    pen "是我！但是......你是谁？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:372
translate chinese intro_667941f6:

    # mox "Wha!? I didn’t even tell him your name!"
    mox "什！？我完全没告诉过他你的名字！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:373
translate chinese intro_fadc6c89:

    # mc "No need, [mox]. I wasn't kidding when I said I knew you and many others from another universe."
    mc "不需要，[mox]。我说我认识你和其他许多来自另一个宇宙的雌驹可不是开玩笑的。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:374
translate chinese intro_9ed08cca:

    # "Taken aback, [pen] took a moment to compose herself before continuing."
    "[pen]被吓了一跳，整理了一下情绪后继续说道。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:376
translate chinese intro_42331504:

    # pen "Hmm… [mox], put the wine back in the fridge. We’ll need clear heads for this."
    pen "唔… [mox]，把酒放回冰箱。我们需要清醒的头脑……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:378
translate chinese intro_59600755:

    # "The three of us sat down, sipping tea and discussing how this could be possible."
    "我们三个坐了下来，一边喝茶，一边讨论这事怎么可能发生。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:379
translate chinese intro_1d6f85f2:

    # "I'd been in many debates and discussions about this topic before, and my knowledge quickly impressed the two mares."
    "我以前进行过很多次关于这个话题的辩论和讨论，我的知识很快就说服了两位雌驹。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:385
translate chinese intro_cf9bd7b8:

    # pen "To summarize... [mox] tried to summon a familiar, but instead brought you from an alternate dimension where you were close friends with another version of [mox]."
    pen "总结一下……[mox] 试图召唤一个傀儡，但却把你从另一个时空带来了，在你那你和另一个版本的[mox]是好朋友。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:386
translate chinese intro_2f00623b:

    # pen "If you really are from an alternate dimension, please prove it by sharing a unique piece of information about me that you would know."
    pen "如果你真的来自另一个时空，请分享一条你知道的关于我的独特信息来证明这一点。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:390
translate chinese intro_6888e44a:

    # pen "No, I’m quite open about my bisexuality. However, given my history of partners, I can see why you’d think that. So, I’ll allow it."
    pen "不，我对自己的双性恋身份很坦然。不过，考虑到我的性伴侣史，我理解你为什么会这么想。所以，我对这点不置可否。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:393
translate chinese intro_178df024:

    # pen "Huh… That is indeed an incredibly specific, albeit correct fact about me."
    pen "嗯……这确实是关于我的一个正确的而且非常具体的事实。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:395
translate chinese intro_535f6cd6:

    # pen "[mox], did you tell him that?"
    pen "[mox]，你有告诉他这回事吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:397
translate chinese intro_f65b5d27:

    # mox "N-No way!"
    mox "绝-绝对没有说过！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:399
translate chinese intro_ddf3b308:

    # pen "While it’s possible you could have intuited that… I’ll accept it for now."
    pen "虽然你有可能是靠直觉发现我们的关系的.....但我暂时接受。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:403
translate chinese intro_892df5e6:

    # pen "Correct! That’s quite the passion of mine."
    pen "没错！这是我的一大爱好。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:404
translate chinese intro_78e90d04:

    # mc "You’ve already chewed my ear off many times talking about your studies. I hope you figure out that luck magic sometime."
    mc "说起你的学业，你已经在我们聊起此事时嚼我耳朵好多次了。我希望你有朝一日能想出幸运之魔法~"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:406
translate chinese intro_4938c0c0:

    # pen "Holy shit… You… know about that?"
    pen "我靠...你...你知道这个？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:407
translate chinese intro_05834a8a:

    # "Looks like I got a perfect score."
    "看来我答了个满分。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:410
translate chinese intro_30290184:

    # pen "You could have prior knowledge of myself or [mox], but for now we’ll accept what you’re telling us for the sake of forwarding the conversation."
    pen "你或许有一点对我和[mox]的了解，为了便于谈话我们会先接受你所说的。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:413
translate chinese intro_e044fb1a:

    # pen "I must say, I’m rather convinced by what you’re saying, even though I’m struggling to understand how this happened."
    pen "我必须说， 虽然我很难理解这一切是如何发生的，但我愿意相信你所说的话。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:415
translate chinese intro_697ab581:

    # pen "Could you tell me what the other universe is like?"
    pen "你能告诉我另一个宇宙是什么样子的吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:417
translate chinese intro_3de05ef1:

    # mc "I need to spend more time here to fully understand the differences, otherwise I’ll end up listing a bunch of things you already know."
    mc "我需要在这待些时间来充分了解这些差异，否则我最后只能罗列出一堆你已经知道的事情。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:418
translate chinese intro_fa33250e:

    # mc "Honestly, I’m still surprised that [mox] lives in an apartment and not a wagon. Are you still a performer?"
    mc "老实说，我还是很惊讶于 [mox] 住在公寓里而不是篷车。你仍是魔术师吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:420
translate chinese intro_85a44ce1:

    # mox "Oh, yes, I'm a well-known performer. But when I first moved to Arcadia a few years ago, I did live in a wagon."
    mox "哦，是的，我现在是一个著名的魔术师。但几年前我刚搬到Arcadia时，确实住在一辆篷车里。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:421
translate chinese intro_f2a04822:

    # mc "So you've been here for a few years instead of a few months. That's quite a surprise."
    mc "这么说，你已经在这里待了几年，而不是几个月。真没想到。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:422
translate chinese intro_89450181:

    # mc "A part of me wonders what other subtle differences there are in this universe… But another part of me dreads those differences."
    mc "我一方面好奇这个宇宙还有哪些微妙的差异……但另一方面我又害怕这些差异。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:424
translate chinese intro_b7fb61b7:

    # mc "Can I really rebuild all those friendships? Will the people here even be the same as in my world?"
    mc "我真的能重建所有的友谊吗？这里的雌驹会和原世界我认识的一样吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:425
translate chinese intro_5640454d:

    # mc "Or am I doomed to be pulled from universe to universe, never settling? It makes me want to shut myself in a room and never leave."
    mc "还是我注定要被从一个宇宙拉到另一个宇宙，永远无法安定下来？一想到这就让我想把自己关在房间里永不出门。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:427
translate chinese intro_3a5f18fe:

    # mox "[mc]..."
    mox "[mc]....."

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:429
translate chinese intro_77284434:

    # pen "You suggested that you were ‘copied’ and ‘pasted’ into this universe, right? There's a chance there's a version of you here."
    pen "你说过你是被 “复制 ”和 “粘贴 ”到这个宇宙的，对吗？那这里有可能存在另一个版本的你。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:430
translate chinese intro_8997a4cc:

    # pen "And that version might be equine, unlike your unique appearance as a hairless ‘human’."
    pen "而且这个你可能是马的版本，不像你如此一个没有毛发的 “人类 ”的独特外表。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:431
translate chinese intro_84823e99:

    # mc "That’s unlikely. From my time in the other Arcadia, I learned that [mox] summoned me because I didn’t exist in that universe."
    mc "这不太可能。根据我在另一个Arcadia的经历，我了解到 [mox] 能够召唤我的前提是我在那个宇宙中并不存在。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:432
translate chinese intro_acb40302:

    # pen "Huh… So, in every universe where you don’t exist, but [mox] does, she somehow summons you?"
    pen "唔… 所以，在每个你不存在，但 [mox] 存在的宇宙中，她都会以某种方式召唤你？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:433
translate chinese intro_8640e5a4:

    # mc "That’s right, I once lived in a third ‘human’ world that I relinquished to live a fulfilling new life in Arcadia. I never expected to be torn away into a new world again."
    mc "没错，我曾经居住在另一个“人类”世界里，我放弃了那个世界，在Arcadia过上充实无忧的生活。我从没想过会再一次被拉入一个新世界。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:434
translate chinese intro_e0d336a0:

    # mc "I naively thought it’d be a single hop for every version of me. But if there are infinite universes with infinite possibilities, then... there will always be versions of me pulled into different universes."
    mc "我天真地以为每个版本的我都只会有一次宇宙跳跃。但是如果存在无限可能的无限宇宙，那么……总会有不同版本的“我”被拉入不同的宇宙。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:436
translate chinese intro_d0ae4c59:

    # mox "Oh no! I’m so, so sorry! I don’t even know how I did this!"
    mox "哦，不，我非常非常抱歉！我都不知道我是怎么做到的！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:437
translate chinese intro_b040b846:

    # mc "You don't have to apologize."
    mc "你没必要道歉。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:439
translate chinese intro_14f0a785:

    # pen "I have my doubts too, [mox]. Spells have strict rules."
    pen "我也有我的疑问，[mox]。施法都有严格的法则。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:441
translate chinese intro_b833b645:

    # pen "But [mc], let’s say you’re right. Your theory of infinite dimensions and the ability to interact between them contradict each other."
    pen "但是[mc]，假设你是对的。你的无限维度理论和维度间的相互作用两者是相互矛盾的。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:442
translate chinese intro_de3de960:

    # mc "Really? Why’s that?"
    mc "真的吗？为什么这么说？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:444
translate chinese intro_117f2a87:

    # pen "Simple. If there are infinite universes and possibilities, there would be a universe capable of destroying every other universe."
    pen "很简单。如果存在无限的宇宙和可能性，那么就会有一个宇宙能够摧毁其他所有宇宙。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:445
translate chinese intro_02957607:

    # "And just like that, my theory is shattered..."
    "我的理论就这样被打破了……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:446
translate chinese intro_57c8ab2b:

    # "But I know multiple universes exist. Some with humans, others with anthropomorphic creatures, and many more..."
    "但我知道有多元宇宙存在，有些人类为主，有些有拟人化的生物，还有更多……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:447
translate chinese intro_69dbac7d:

    # "Could that all really… not exist?"
    "难道这一切真的.....不存在？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:449
translate chinese intro_4b39ccd6:

    # pen "I hate to erase your existence, [mc], but I’m going to come to my conclusion based on the information so far…"
    pen "我不想抹杀你存在这一事实，[mc]，但这是我根据目前的信息得出结论..."

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:450
translate chinese intro_a861e751:

    # pen "In my opinion, it seems far more likely that you’re a familiar that was somehow implanted with memories. You know a lot of things [mox] knows, who’s to say you’re not a fictional character that her brain concocted?"
    pen "在我看来，你更有可能是一个被植入了记忆的傀儡。你知道很多[mox]知道的事情，但谁又能保证你不是她大脑虚构出来的呢？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:452
translate chinese intro_8841b008:

    # mox "Does that mean he’s going to disappear soon? The spell only lasts sixty minutes, and with my limited abilities, I can’t imagine it lasting even thirty."
    mox "这是不是意味着他很快就会消失？这个魔法只能持续六十分钟，以我有限的能力，持续三十分钟都够呛。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:454
translate chinese intro_7cdf66a5:

    # pen "That certainly remains to be seen."
    pen "这当然还有待观察。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:455
translate chinese intro_d4dc90e2:

    # "A feeling of dread rises from within me. This can't be right, can it? I know I lived with another [mox] in a wagon. I didn’t disappear then... but if my memories are fake..."
    "一股恐惧感自我内心升起。这不可能吧？我知道我和另一个[mox]住在一辆篷车里。我当时并没有消失......但如果我的记忆是假的......"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:456
translate chinese intro_39b3d984:

    # mc "No way! My memories can't be fake; I know things that even [mox] doesn’t know."
    mc "不可能！我的记忆不可能是假的；我知道连 [mox] 都不知道的事情。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:458
translate chinese intro_e8104fba:

    # pen "You’ve yet to actually prove that yet."
    pen "你还没有真正证明这一点。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:459
translate chinese intro_4d1064a7:

    # "Hmm… I need to say something that [mox] doesn’t know but [pen] does… But what? They’re such close friends that anything surface-level won’t work."
    "Hmm… 我需要说一些[mox]不知道但[pen]知道的话......但说什么呢？他们是如此亲密的朋友，任何浅显的事情都不足以证明我的说法..."

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:460
translate chinese intro_7e7f0c52:

    # "[pen] loves movies, doesn’t she? No, [mox] would obviously know that too… Maybe something about [lil]? No, [mox] knows her as well."
    "[pen] 喜欢电影，不是吗？不能说这个，[mox]显然也知道......那关于 [lil] 的事呢？不行，[mox] 也认识她。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:461
translate chinese intro_1c2e0373:

    # "Wait, that's it! The other five girls! I just need to prove I know something about them."
    "等等，对了！另外五个女孩！我只需要证明我对她们有所了解就行了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:462
translate chinese intro_caf80c8e:

    # mc "[but]! I can tell you something about her that [mox] definitely doesn’t know, and we can confirm it with her."
    mc "[but]！我可以告诉你一些 [mox] 肯定不知道的关于她的事，我可以借此向她证实。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:464
translate chinese intro_66391b89:

    # pen "[but]...? Who’s that?"
    pen "[but]……?那是谁？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:465
translate chinese intro_d9b4cfca:

    # mc "... Eh? You don’t know who [but] is?"
    mc "……啊？你不知道[but]是谁？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:466
translate chinese intro_c7082082:

    # "That’s odd… Did these two not interact at all in the other world? Let’s try someone a bit closer, another unicorn."
    "奇怪……难道这两个雌驹在这个世界没有任何交集？那试试看和她们更熟悉的另一个角马。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:467
translate chinese intro_3eafa7bd:

    # mc "Okay, what about [rub]? I know quite a few secrets about her!"
    mc "好吧，那 [rub] 呢？我知道很多关于她的秘密！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:469
translate chinese intro_d3f1470e:

    # pen "[rub]? Never heard of her."
    pen "[rub]？从来没听说过她。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:471
translate chinese intro_fe5ee77a:

    # mox "That name sounds familiar though…"
    mox "不过这个名字听起来很熟悉……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:472
translate chinese intro_8f836a12:

    # mc "W-Wait… Seriously? [rik], then! [mox] has definitely met her before; she owns a nearby bar!"
    mc "什-等等…… 真的吗？那[rik]，[mox]肯定见过她，她是附近一家酒吧的老板！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:474
translate chinese intro_cada7660:

    # pen "You mean the star flier of the Storm Chasers? Maybe your memories are just a dreamlike jumble. Nothing you’re saying reflects this reality."
    pen "你是说Storm Chasers的明星飞马？也许你的记忆只是梦境般的混乱碎片， 你所说的这一切都不能反映现实。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:475
translate chinese intro_a4de4888:

    # mc "You’re… kidding… You don’t know these people? [hon]? [cre]?"
    mc "你...在开玩笑吧……你不认识她们？[hon]？[cre]？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:477
translate chinese intro_5d271248:

    # pen "Nope…"
    pen "不……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:479
translate chinese intro_83d42608:

    # mox "Nuh-uh… Sorry…"
    mox "不认识……抱歉……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:480
translate chinese intro_59dbeb87:

    # "I can’t believe this… What kind of crazy universe did I stumble into? They exist… r-right?"
    "真不敢相信……我到底闯入了什么样的疯狂宇宙？她们存在……对-对吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:481
translate chinese intro_527d9c37:

    # mc "Hold it, [pen]! You said my memories don’t reflect reality, but I guarantee these girls all exist. That's my proof that I’m from a parallel reality that mirrors this one."
    mc "等等，[pen]！你说我的记忆不反映现实，但我保证这些女孩都存在，这就是我的证据。证明我来自一个真实存在的平行世界，和这个世界一样真实而且近乎镜像。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:483
translate chinese intro_36ec56c8:

    # pen "We can check that, but… what are the odds? Who gets flung into another universe with the exact same people?"
    pen "我们可以查证一下，但是……几率有多大？谁被扔进另一个有着完全一致的马的宇宙？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:484
translate chinese intro_a88ea3ba:

    # mc "I… don’t know… I can only hope."
    mc "我......不确定......我只能希望我是对的。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:486
translate chinese intro_6bc0fc74:

    # pen "I’m willing to help and give you the benefit of the doubt. But there's one big thing confusing me… How can [mox], who is an excellent magician, but far from an expert in magic, perform this impossible feat?"
    pen "我愿意帮你，也愿意相信你的说辞。但有一件事让我很困惑……[mox]是个出色的魔术师，但远不是专业的魔法师，她是怎么施展出这道几近奇迹的魔法的？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:487
translate chinese intro_4b514d6a:

    # mc "That’s easy. She’s a distant relative of the princess."
    mc "很简单。她是公主的远亲。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:491
translate chinese intro_935b6ba7:

    # "The room goes quiet, and the two mares share a confused glance."
    "房间一下子安静了下来，两匹雌驹困惑地对视了一眼。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:493
translate chinese intro_3d9992c3:

    # pen "What did you say…?"
    pen "你说......?"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:494
translate chinese intro_9de60fa5:

    # mc "The princess of the moon? [sel]?"
    mc "月之公主[sel]呀？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:496
translate chinese intro_588f5b9a:

    # mox "I’ve never heard of anyone like that. As far as I know, the Queen is an only child."
    mox "我从来没听说过有这位公主。据我所知，女王是独生女。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:497
translate chinese intro_b54e9368:

    # mc "What..? But…"
    mc "什么……?但……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:498
translate chinese intro_49bc1801:

    # "Have I made a mistake? A feeling of dread spreads through my gut, my body growing numb. Is this universe really so different? I need to find out."
    "难道是我犯错了吗？一股恐惧的感觉在我的心中蔓延，身体逐渐变得麻木。这个宇宙真就如此不同？？我必须查明真相。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:499
translate chinese intro_f58f50fa:

    # "If I could access the mirrors in the castle… A secret collection of portals to other universes. Could I return that way?"
    "如果我能去使用城堡里的镜子的话……那是通往其他宇宙的秘密入口。我能够从那里回去吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:500
translate chinese intro_204a5e12:

    # mc "Would it be possible for me to visit Queen [aur]? There’s a chance I could go back home through her."
    mc "我有可能去拜访女王 [aur] 吗？我有可能通过她的帮助回家。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:504
translate chinese intro_f28f515c:

    # "Once again, the girls look completely baffled."
    "再一次的，女孩们露出困惑的表情。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:506
translate chinese intro_d704e0fc:

    # pen "Getting an audience with the Queen is no small feat. The security to the inner city is tight, and you don’t have a pass."
    pen "觐见女王可不是件小事。内城戒备森严，而你没有通行证。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:508
translate chinese intro_a90e06da:

    # mox "Can't [lil] get off her ass and help?"
    mox "难道 [lil] 就不能动下她的屁股帮帮忙吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:510
translate chinese intro_0305cf7b:

    # pen "Maybe? I could try talking to her... Still, it'd be asking a lot."
    pen "也许？我可以试着跟她谈谈……不过这要求很难达成。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:513
translate chinese intro_fa385383:

    # "Overwhelmed and confused, I take a moment to look out the window and absorb the landscape. This isn't a village, suburb, or fantasy castle. It's a cityscape. With the sky overcast and rain pouring down, it feels grim."
    "我感到困惑，不知所措，花了些时间望向窗外，欣赏窗外的风景。这里不是村庄、郊区，也不是梦幻城堡。这是一副城市景观。天空阴沉沉的，大雨倾盆而下，给人一种阴沉的感觉。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:514
translate chinese intro_16586f10:

    # "Ah… How could I forget? [mox] might be possessed by Morrigan! I could be in danger right now."
    "啊……我怎么忘了这回事？[mox] 可能被 Morrigan 附身了！我现在可能身处危险之中。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:515
translate chinese intro_b23743f5:

    # mc "[pen]... You’re a morphling, aren’t you?"
    mc "[pen]……你是个幻形灵，对吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:518
translate chinese intro_364b647f:

    # pen "Huh?! Where did you get that idea? I’m just a regular unicorn. The morphlings and their Queen were defeated a long time ago."
    pen "蛤？！你怎么会有这种想法？我只是一只普通的角马，幻形灵和他们的女王很久以前就被打败了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:519
translate chinese intro_527e7b5c:

    # mc "Seriously? So [mox] isn’t…"
    mc "真的？所以[mox]不是……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:522
translate chinese intro_f9df1370:

    # mox "I’m just [mox]!"
    mox "我只是[mox]！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:524
translate chinese intro_4f47331c:

    # pen "Tch, seriously… If all this is true, your universe sounds crazy."
    pen "啧啧，说真的……如果这事是真的，你那宇宙感觉挺颠的。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:525
translate chinese intro_63f7c173:

    # "That’s the tipping point. I can't rely on any of my existing knowledge or expectations about this universe. We're in completely uncharted territory."
    "差异已经到达了临界点。我不能再指望我现有的知识或者对这个宇宙的期望了。我陷入了完全未知的领域。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:527
translate chinese intro_b1ea9c6d:

    # mox "I want to help you fit into this new universe, especially since I might be the one who brought you here. I feel guilty about this, so…"
    mox "我想帮你融入这个新世界，特别是因为可能是我把你带到这里的。对此我感到内疚，所以……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:529
translate chinese intro_b2941443:

    # pen "You’re such a softy! But, ahh… I kind of see what you mean."
    pen "你真是个软蛋！不过嘛，啊……我有点明白你的意思了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:531
translate chinese intro_b89b1c3a:

    # pen "Alright, I’m extremely busy with college, but I’ll try my best to contact the mares you mentioned. I can’t promise anything."
    pen "好吧，我现在在大学里非常忙，但我会尽力联系你提到的雌驹。但我不能保证有结果。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:532
translate chinese intro_06ac7045:

    # pen "I still don’t know what you are—a familiar based on [mox]’s memories, a philosophical zombie of your original self, or merely an interdimensional copy. But whatever and whoever you are, there’s a chance you might exist here for the rest of your life."
    pen "我仍然不知道你是什么——是基于[mox]记忆的召唤物，还是你本体的哲学僵尸，又或者仅仅是一个异次元副本。但不管你是谁，你都有可能得在这里度过余生。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:533
translate chinese intro_d37929ad:

    # pen "We can debate existential topics and get nihilistic, and sure, there could be a version of you copied and faxed over to another universe every second. But right now, you exist here and will always exist in this world."
    pen "我们可以讨论存在主义的话题以致于转向虚无主义，当然，每时每刻都可能有一个版本的你被复制并被传真到另一个宇宙。但现在，你存在于这里，并将大概率永远存在于这个世界。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:535
translate chinese intro_b56549f4:

    # mox "That’s right! You need to make the most of it, and I’ll do my best to help you!"
    mox "那可不！你得要尽可能接受它适应它，而我会尽我所能帮助你！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:536
translate chinese intro_4aaab500:

    # mc "As you can imagine, this isn’t the first time you both have been so helpful and kind to me. I really appreciate you saving my ass again."
    mc "你们难以想象这已经不是你们第一次对我这么好了。我真的很感激你们又救了我一命。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:538
translate chinese intro_cb33fcc0:

    # pen "There’s only one slight problem left. You were summoned about forty minutes ago, right? There’s a chance you might disappear soon."
    pen "只剩下一个小问题了。你是四十分钟前被召唤来的，对吧？你有可能很快就消失了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:539
translate chinese intro_96d88e93:

    # pen "I admit, we actually had some specific reasons for summoning you."
    pen "实际上，我们是因为一些具体的原因才召唤你的……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:540
translate chinese intro_b02c16d5:

    # mc "Oh don’t tell me… It’s mating season?"
    mc "噢~别告诉我……现在已经是发情期了？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:545
translate chinese intro_3b873c34:

    # mox "{i}Gasp{/i} He really does know everything!"
    mox "{i}惊叹{/i} 他真的什么都知道！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:547
translate chinese intro_a72d8f1b:

    # pen "Ahaha, if you really have prior experiences with us, then I can only say that we've summoned the right partner."
    pen "啊哈哈，如果你真的有过与我们“合作”的经历，那我只能说我们找对了搭档。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:548
translate chinese intro_90e0cce0:

    # pen "Given the circumstances, you may disappear, so it only seems fair that you get to join in."
    pen "鉴于现在的情况，你可能会消失，所以让你加入进来似乎很合理。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:550
translate chinese intro_7a4e03c6:

    # pen "And if you don't, let's call it a wild start to your new life."
    pen "如果你不会消失，那就让它成为你新生活的狂野开端吧。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:553
translate chinese intro_f1f7e1cf:

    # mc "Some things never change. All right girls, show me what you’ve got."
    mc "有些事情大概永远不会改变。好吧，姑娘们，拿出你们的看家本领吧。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:556
translate chinese intro_a0583405:

    # pen "Not sudden for us! We’ve been planning this for six days."
    pen "对我们来说可不算“突击测试”！咱们已经计划这事六天了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:558
translate chinese intro_0598d23d:

    # mox "[mc] does have a point. It's different from using a familiar. It feels more personal and intimate, and since this is one of my first times, it carries weight."
    mox "[mc] 说的有道理。这和差使傀儡不一样。这会更加私密且暧昧，而且由于这是我第一次这么做，因而这很有意义。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:559
translate chinese intro_00c5a493:

    # mc "Exactly!"
    mc "没错！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:561
translate chinese intro_e3e84b68:

    # pen "Hm… Well, it’s up to you, [mc]. Want us to blow your mind?"
    pen "嗯……好吧，这取决于你，[mc]。想让我们让你大吃一惊吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:565
translate chinese intro_c739e8f0:

    # pen "Don’t mind if I do~"
    pen "那我就不客气了~"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:569
translate chinese intro_947593d6:

    # pen "Hm… given the circumstances, that’s fair enough…"
    pen "好吧……鉴于这种情况，这倒也公平……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:571
translate chinese intro_d09ec17f:

    # pen "Let’s give this another shot later, lover boy."
    pen "不如我们以后再试试吧，小帅哥~"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:573
translate chinese intro_cd035370:

    # mox "Yeah! – Uh, I mean, r-right…"
    mox "耶！——呃，我是说，好-好的……"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:574
translate chinese intro_7762a746:

    # "These two seem pent up!"
    "她们俩看起来压抑的有点久了！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:577
translate chinese intro_efad1cd3:

    # "I’d barely noticed it, but the two girls had slowly been edging closer to me throughout the entire conversation. Of course, they were both nude, but I was so occupied with my thoughts that I somehow missed their clear arousal and interest."
    "我几乎没有注意到，在整个谈话过程中两个女孩一直在慢慢靠近我。虽然她们都是裸体的，但我想得太入神了，以至于忽略了她们明显的兴奋和性趣。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:578
translate chinese intro_152c252f:

    # "Right now, they were pincering me from either side."
    "她们现在正对我形成两面包夹之势。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:580
translate chinese intro_3f957cf6:

    # mox "He looks so exotic, doesn’t he?"
    mox "他身上很有异国情调，不是吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:581
translate chinese intro_c3d8771e:

    # pen "This scar gives him a lot of character!"
    pen "这条伤疤让他很有特色！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:582
translate chinese intro_aa7557a6:

    # mox "Oh look! It's getting even bigger!"
    mox "哦，快看！它变得更大喽！"

