translate chinese lilybuttjob3_24bf30aa:

    # mox "Ahh, uhm... N-No! It's fine!"
    mox "啊啊，额......不-不！没事！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1461
translate chinese lilybuttjob3_91f23204:

    # pen "Your loss~"
    pen "你的损失~"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1467
translate chinese lilybuttjob3_db68f8f3:

    # "The girls hop off my body and instead snuggle up to my sides. [mox] on my left shoulder, [pen] on my right."
    "女孩们跳下我的身体，依偎在我的两侧。[mox] 在我的左肩上，[pen] 在我的右肩上。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1468
translate chinese lilybuttjob3_195cac52:

    # "Huh… How did I end up here? I was transported into this universe only about 12 hours ago."
    "呃唔......大约12个小时前我才被传送到这个宇宙了，现在怎么发展到这种地步了？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1480
translate chinese intropart3_3e40b63e:

    # pen "There’s been a thought nagging at me..."
    pen "有一个想法一直在困扰着我..."

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1481
translate chinese intropart3_22561212:

    # pen "Let’s say you do get back, [mc]… What if there are two of you?"
    pen "如果你真的回去了，[mc]......又如果有两个你呢？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1482
translate chinese intropart3_2da06df8:

    # mc "I figured this would come up. What if I was ‘copied’ instead of ‘pasted,’ right? The original me probably still exists."
    mc "我有想到会这样。如果我是被 “复制 ”而不是 “剪切 ”的呢？原来的我可能还在。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1483
translate chinese intropart3_64b2a235:

    # mc "I've thought about it. Even if there are two of me, I think my Arcadia would be open and accepting of that. Might even be fun."
    mc "我想过了，即使有两个我，我想我的Arcadia也会坦然接受。甚至会很有趣"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1485
translate chinese intropart3_ad34850d:

    # pen "You’ve got me there, but let’s take my example to its next logical conclusion... What if there are three of you? Four of you? Infinite universes, infinite you. Or so the theory goes."
    pen "你说对了，但让我们把我的例子推导到下一个逻辑结论... 如果有三个你呢？四个你？无限的宇宙，无限的你，理论上是可能的。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1487
translate chinese intropart3_8ca09d33:

    # mox "Mmm… I wouldn’t mind infinite of him."
    mox "嗯......我不介意无穷无尽的他。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1488
translate chinese intropart3_b69c8e5f:

    # mc "That’s probably the exact problem, [mox]! So you're saying this issue is bigger than me?"
    mc "这可能正是问题所在，[mox]！你是说这个问题比我本身还严重？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1490
translate chinese intropart3_0f5965ac:

    # pen "How can you ever rest knowing that you could get torn into yet another universe, and another, and another, forevermore?"
    pen "如果你知道自己可能会被撕裂到另一个宇宙，另一个宇宙，另一个宇宙，直到永远，你怎么能安息？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1491
translate chinese intropart3_2c8bd109:

    # pen "The thought alone haunts me."
    pen "光是这个想法就令我寝食难安。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1492
translate chinese intropart3_ea078473:

    # mc "It could be happening to us all, though."
    mc "不过，这可能发生在我们每一个的身上。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1494
translate chinese intropart3_dafdfeba:

    # pen "Maybe – but we know it’s definitely happening to you."
    pen "也许吧——但我们知道这肯定发生在了你身上。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1495
translate chinese intropart3_13717b19:

    # pen "If I were you, I’d do everything to anchor myself to this reality, so you never have to go through this again."
    pen "如果我是你，我会想尽一切办法让自己锚地在这个现实中，这样你就再也不用经历这些了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1496
translate chinese intropart3_d532512d:

    # pen "If all this interdimensional magic is real, there should be a way to nullify it. Ordinary magic has such counters."
    pen "如果所有这些跨宇宙魔法都是真的，那就应该有办法让它失效。普通魔法就有这样的对策。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1497
translate chinese intropart3_b1c6d7c5:

    # mc "Now that’s some real food for thought."
    mc "这才是真正值得思考的问题。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1499
translate chinese intropart3_eec73810:

    # mox "And I’m starving!"
    mox "而我快饿死了！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1500
translate chinese intropart3_79cfbe14:

    # "[pen] and I glance over at [mox], whose stomach growls."
    "[pen] 和我一同看向 [mox]，她的肚子在咕咕叫。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1502
translate chinese intropart3_b9174f70:

    # mox "Sorry, hearing ‘food’ sent me over the edge there."
    mox "对不起，一听到 你们说“寝食难安”，我就忍不住想到吃的了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1504
translate chinese intropart3_e212d9e0:

    # pen "Hah, all right. You two scoot off now and keep me in the loop with your progress finding those ladies."
    pen "蛤，好吧。你们俩现在就吃饭去吧，找到那些女士的进展记得及时告诉我。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1505
translate chinese intropart3_5b593efc:

    # mc "Will do. Thanks again, [pen]."
    mc "我会的。再次感谢你，[pen]。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1509
translate chinese intropart3_46710180:

    # "[mox] and I leave the treehouse and head to one of her favourite restaurants. The food is excellent but far more expensive than I’m used to."
    "我和 [mox] 离开树屋，前往她最喜欢的一家餐馆。那里的食物非常美味，但价格却比我映像里贵得多。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1510
translate chinese intropart3_65e45be1:

    # "This may be the perfect opportunity to try and learn some historic and cultural differences between the Arcadias."
    "这也许是尝试了解两地Arcadia之间的历史和文化差异的绝佳机会。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1511
translate chinese intropart3_61bba690:

    # "Once back at her place, we settle on the couch to talk."
    "一回到她家，我们就坐在沙发上聊天。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1517
translate chinese intropart3_915478c6:

    # mox "So I heard you met everyone's favourite shut-in, [lil]. That must have been something. Was it everything you expected as someone that saw another version of her before?"
    mox "我听说你去见了大家最-喜-欢的自闭宅女 [lil]。那一定很特别。作为一个之前见过她另一个版本的人，这一切都符合你的预期吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1518
translate chinese intropart3_53d173d5:

    # mc "This [lil] in a bit of a rougher state than I expected. Her bedroom was a mess, for a start."
    mc "这[lil]的状况比我想象的要糟糕一些。首先，她的卧室一团糟。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1519
translate chinese intropart3_3092083c:

    # mc "But ultimately, she seems as reliable as ever. I asked her to check if there were any other versions of me out there in this universe, she'll have checked for me by the next time I see her."
    mc "但归根结底，她还是一如既往地可靠。我让她查查这个宇宙中是否还有其他版本的我，下次我再见到她时，她就会帮我查清楚了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1521
translate chinese intropart3_462cae24:

    # mox "She can just do that? I can't believe how proficient [lil] is with magic, she really is a natural born prodigy."
    mox "她居然能这么做？真不敢相信 [lil] 对魔法如此精通，她真是个天生的神童。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1522
translate chinese intropart3_1fb1c436:

    # mc "Surprisingly, a different type of magic involved in extracting my DNA."
    mc "令我惊讶的是，在提取我DNA的过程中使用了另一种魔法。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1524
translate chinese intropart3_5b953e2a:

    # mox "Why? What other methods did she use? A swab on the tongue?"
    mox "什么？她还使用了什么方法？用棉签采集你的唾液？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1525
translate chinese intropart3_4deb279e:

    # mc "I'll leave it to your imagination."
    mc "就让你自己想象吧。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1527
translate chinese intropart3_d565ba98:

    # mox "Hmm... Hmm... Oh! Oooohhhhh... Didn't think she had it in her."
    mox "唔... 嘶... 哦！噢！噢噢噢......没想到她还有这一手。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1528
translate chinese intropart3_8d48f711:

    # mc "You might not realize it, but you're a prodigy too. You're the reason I'm here, after all."
    mc "你可能没意识到，但你确实是个小机灵鬼。毕竟你是我在这里的原因。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1530
translate chinese intropart3_c0b5f7c0:

    # mox "I've been thinking about that, you see... There might be some truth to what you say, but I don't think I'm the one that brought you here."
    mox "我一直在想这个问题，你看... 你说的也许有些道理 但我不认为是我把你带到这里来的"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1531
translate chinese intropart3_6f81b860:

    # mc "I'm telling the truth, though. This is what happened in my last universe."
    mc "但我说的也是实话。这就是我上一个宇宙发生的事情。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1533
translate chinese intropart3_38f859a3:

    # mox "It's not that I don't believe you. Maybe I can perform magic like that, but... accidentally?"
    mox "我不是不相信你。也许我能表演这样那样的魔术，但是......这个的话？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1534
translate chinese intropart3_3af3decd:

    # mc "Yeah, while you were trying to summon a familiar, right?"
    mc "是啊，当你试图召唤一个傀儡时，对不？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1537
translate chinese intropart3_aba91e00:

    # mox "But, [mc]... I wasn't trying to summon a familiar when you appeared."
    mox "但是，[mc]... 你出现的时候我并不想召唤傀儡。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1538
translate chinese intropart3_90839ce2:

    # mox "I wasn't casting any magic at all at the time."
    mox "当时我根本没有施放任何魔法。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1539
translate chinese intropart3_33d12b5c:

    # mc "W-What? But then... How?"
    mc "什-什么？！但是，这。。。怎么会？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1541
translate chinese intropart3_d881e433:

    # mox "I... have no idea. You just appeared."
    mox "我......不知道。你就这么出现了"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1542
translate chinese intropart3_60aa68c3:

    # mox "At the time, you were so certain that I cast the spell; you almost convinced me too, but... I really didn't."
    mox "当时，你非常肯定是我施了咒语；你几乎也说服了我，但是...... 我真的没有"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1543
translate chinese intropart3_7db187b6:

    # mc "If you didn't cast the spell, then who? The only other person I could think of is... [sel]... You told me you'd never heard of her..."
    mc "如果不是你施的咒语，那会是谁？我能想到的其他人是...[sel]... 你说你从来没听说过她..."

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1544
translate chinese intropart3_e39c3575:

    # "There's a slight shiver down my spine as I try to piece the mystery together to no avail."
    "我的脊背微微颤抖，试图拼凑出这个谜团，但毫无结果。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1547
translate chinese intropart3_5f6ec1f0:

    # mox "Sorry... I've not been very helpful. But I wasn't just completely goofing off this afternoon, I picked up something you could use at work!"
    mox "对不起... 我帮不上什么忙。但我今天下午不只是在胡闹，我挑选了你工作上用得着的东西！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1548
translate chinese intropart3_000e6ad0:

    # "[mox] takes something out of a nearby drawer and hands it to me. It's a device I certainly recognize but of a type I haven't seen in a long time."
    "[mox] 从旁边的抽屉里拿出一个东西递给我。这个装置我当然认得，但已经很久没有见过了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1551
translate chinese intropart3_fa19665e:

    # mc "A mobile phone? A smart phone no less."
    mc "一个手机？还是智能手机。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1552
translate chinese intropart3_21272fee:

    # mox "Correct! Are you familiar with how to work it?"
    mox "当然！你知道该怎么用吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1553
translate chinese intropart3_77807739:

    # mc "More or less, let's see..."
    mc "或多或少知道点，让我看看......"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1558
translate chinese intropart3_2314b46a:

    # "I press the button on the right and it turns on."
    "我按下右边的按钮，它就开机了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1559
translate chinese intropart3_3e0a9dc4:

    # mox "This is an old phone of mine, I thought it'd be a lot more useful for you than gathering dust in my drawer."
    mox "这是我的一部旧手机，我想它对你来说会比放在抽屉里吃灰更有用。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1560
translate chinese intropart3_8104016c:

    # mox "I already have a bunch of things already installed on there. I'm not sure what you do know and what you don't, so just ask me anything!"
    mox "我已经在上面安装了很多东西。我不知道你想要什么，也知道你不太了解我们这，所以有什么问题尽管问我！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1563
translate chinese introphonetut_398fd90d:

    # mox "If you give your number to others, they'll be able to send you handy messages from wherever, whenever. I'd make a habit of sharing your number with everyone you meet."
    mox "如果你把自己的号码告诉其他马，他们就可以随时随地给你发送短信。你得养成习惯，与你遇到的每个马分享你的电话号码。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1565
translate chinese introphonetut_b461dd44:

    # mox "I use this app all the time! It keeps me on track for what I have to do next."
    mox "我一直在使用这个应用程序！它让我知道下一步该做什么。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1566
translate chinese introphonetut_523c8a04:

    # mc "Good idea. I'll add all my leads and goals in here so I can stay focused."
    mc "好主意。我会把我所有的线索和目标都添加到这里，这样我就能保持专注了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1568
translate chinese introphonetut_8895a434:

    # mox "If you take any pictures, they'll appear here. You can browse them again on your phone whenever you want."
    mox "如果你拍了照片，它们就会出现在这里。你可以随时在手机上再次浏览它们。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1569
translate chinese introphonetut_ed94bcfe:

    # mox "I think there might already be a few in there already!"
    mox "我想里面可能已经有一些了！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1571
translate chinese introphonetut_b63d578b:

    # mox "That's a social website where people post general updates. You can use it to keep up to date with your friends, or things happening around the city."
    mox "这是一个社交软件，大家都喜欢在上面发自己的动态。你可以用它来了解朋友的最新动态或城市周围发生的事情。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1572
translate chinese introphonetut_1d7d1a6d:

    # mox "Like the other apps, you'll see a notification if there's a new post there."
    mox "与其他应用程序一样，如果有新的帖子，你会看到通知的。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1574
translate chinese introphonetut_d7919a64:

    # mox "Enchanted Threads is a favorite online store of mine. It typically sells clothing. It's handy for me because I wear a cape and hat when performing."
    mox "Enchanted Threads 是我最喜欢的一家网上商店。它主要销售服装。这对我来说很方便，因为我在表演时会穿斗篷戴帽子。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1575
translate chinese introphonetut_b44e1437:

    # mox "And Midnight Emporium, uhm... is a little embarrassing. It's an online sex shop that sells whatever your imagination can conjure, and worse!"
    mox "而 “Midnight Emporium”，呃......有点尴尬。它是一家网上成人用品商店，卖些你完全想象不到的东西，甚至更糟！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1577
translate chinese introphonetut_ba73bd70:

    # mox "Here you can listen to any music. This phone is already full of music, so feel free to give it a listen."
    mox "这个软件可以听音乐。我在手机里已经存了很多音乐了，随便听。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1580
translate chinese introphonetut_af913a8c:

    # mox "Ah, that's just some silly app I forgot to remove. It promised to add 'cheats' to reality, like infinite money, and out of curiosity I installed it. Obviously I never got it to work. Maybe you'd have better luck? Ahaha."
    mox "啊，那只是一个我忘了删除的无聊应用程序。它承诺能在现实中添加 “作弊 ”功能，比如虚空生钱，出于好奇，我安装了它。很显然，它从来没起过作用。也许你的运气会更好？啊哈哈。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1583
translate chinese introphonetut_c75e6ba9:

    # mox "Here you can change the phone's background, various sound settings, text size, and other things. You know."
    mox "在这里你可以更改手机背景、各种声音设置、文字大小等。你懂的。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1594
translate chinese introphonetut2_e3410c43:

    # mox "Oh, and you'll be able to open your phone up almost whenever you want! I won't blame you for being rude! Although some may~"
    mox "哦，你几乎可以随时随地打开手机！我不会责怪你的无礼！但有些马会~"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1595
translate chinese introphonetut2_1452f6b7:

    # mox "Why don't you give it a try now? I'll send you a message!"
    mox "为什么不试试呢？我会给你发消息的！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1602
translate chinese moxmsgloop_44d40d34:

    # "(You just received a message! See that notification in the top right? Try pressing the phone icon!)"
    "(您刚刚收到一条信息！看到右上角的通知了吗？按一下手机图标试试！)"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1604
translate chinese moxmsgloop_d42b38fb:

    # mox "Fine, you don't have to read it~"
    mox "好吧，你不必读它~"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1608
translate chinese moxmsgloop_08b249c5:

    # mox "Aren't you going to check it?"
    mox "你不打算检查一下吗？"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1611
translate chinese moxmsgloop_fa813204:

    # mc "Wow, that was quite a forward message!"
    mc "哇，这真是一条前卫的信息！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1613
translate chinese moxmsgloop_dec04409:

    # mox "Haha, it's easier to be more forward when it's over text instead of face-to-face."
    mox "哈哈，通过文字而不是面对面交流，更容易让马产生好感~"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1614
translate chinese moxmsgloop_fd15f2fd:

    # mc "But I'm right here!"
    mc "但我就在这儿！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1616
translate chinese moxmsgloop_e99040ff:

    # mox "Hey, don't apply logic to the stuff I say!"
    mox "嘿，别把逻辑理性套在我说的话上！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1617
translate chinese moxmsgloop_505d694d:

    # mc "Thank you so much, I only have one question... Where am I supposed to put this? I have no pockets."
    mc "非常感谢，只有一个问题...... 我应该把这个放哪儿？我没有口袋"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1619
translate chinese moxmsgloop_86b681fb:

    # mox "Ahah, don't worry, I thought about that too! Here, take one of my satchels."
    mox "啊哈，别担心，我也想到了！来，拿着我的背包。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1620
translate chinese moxmsgloop_f850a20f:

    # mc "You're too good for me."
    mc "你对我真的太好了。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1622
translate chinese moxmsgloop_2366e3c3:

    # mox "I know you'll return the favor for all my help eventually, right? Ehehe."
    mox "我知道你最终会回报我的帮助的，对吧？诶嘿嘿"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1623
translate chinese moxmsgloop_b7ba9b75:

    # mc "That's a tall order considering how much you've done for me already. But I will try my best."
    mc "考虑到你已经为我做了这么多，哪怕这个要求很高。我也会尽力而为。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1625
translate chinese moxmsgloop_31adade8:

    # mox "Awh, I was only kidding! Well, actually I was trying to make a naughty joke."
    mox "啊哈，我只是开个玩笑！好吧，其实我是想开个调皮的玩笑。"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1626
translate chinese moxmsgloop_98a35b56:

    # mc "Ahaha, if that's the case, I can deliver!"
    mc "啊哈哈，如果是这样的话，我可以自投罗网！"

# game/2 - Intro.rpy:1628
translate chinese moxmsgloop_31664f3d:

